#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_4xx.rst:3
msgid "Upgrading from 3.x to 4.x"
msgstr "3.x에서 4.x로 업그레이드"

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_4xx.rst:5
msgid ""
"CodeIgniter 4 is a rewrite of the framework and is not backwards "
"compatible. It is more appropriate to think of converting your app, "
"rather than upgrading it. Once you have done that, upgrading from one "
"version of CodeIgniter 4 to the next will be straightforward."
msgstr ""
"CodeIgniter 4는 프레임워크의 완전한 재작성이며 하위 호환성이 없습니다. 업그레이드보다는 앱을 변환하는 것으로 이해하는 것이 "
"더 적절합니다. 변환이 완료되면 CodeIgniter 4의 한 버전에서 다음 버전으로 업그레이드하는 것은 간단합니다."

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_4xx.rst:10
msgid ""
"The \"lean, mean and simple\" philosophy has been retained, but the "
"implementation has a lot of differences, compared to CodeIgniter 3."
msgstr ""
"\"군살 없고, 강력하며, 단순하다\"는 철학은 유지되었지만, 구현 방식은 CodeIgniter 3에 비해 많이 달라졌습니다."

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_4xx.rst:13
msgid ""
"There is no 12-step checklist for upgrading. Instead, start with a copy "
"of CodeIgniter 4 in a new project folder, :doc:`however you wish to "
"install and use it </installation/index>`, and then convert and integrate"
" your app components. We'll try to point out the most important "
"considerations here."
msgstr ""
"업그레이드를 위한 12단계 체크리스트는 없습니다. 대신 새 프로젝트 폴더에 CodeIgniter 4를 :doc:`원하는 설치 방법 "
"</installation/index>`\\ 으로 설치한 후, 앱 컴포넌트를 변환하고 통합하세요. 여기서는 가장 중요한 고려 사항들을 "
"안내하겠습니다."

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_4xx.rst:19
msgid ""
"To upgrade your project, we figured out two major tasks you have to work "
"on. First of all, there are some general adjustments which are "
"significant to every project and have to be handled. The second one are "
"the libraries in which CodeIgniter is built up and contain some of the "
"most important functions. These libraries operate separately from each "
"other, so you have to look at them one by one."
msgstr ""
"프로젝트를 업그레이드하려면 두 가지 주요 작업을 수행해야 합니다. 첫째, 모든 프로젝트에 중요한 일반적인 조정 사항이 있으며 반드시 "
"처리해야 합니다. 둘째, CodeIgniter가 구축된 라이브러리들이 있으며 중요한 기능들을 포함하고 있습니다. 이 라이브러리들은 "
"서로 독립적으로 운영되므로 하나씩 검토해야 합니다."

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_4xx.rst:26
msgid "**Do read the user guide** before embarking on a project conversion!"
msgstr "프로젝트 변환을 시작하기 전에 **반드시 사용자 가이드를 읽으세요**!"

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_4xx.rst:33
msgid "General Adjustments"
msgstr "일반 조정 사항"

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_4xx.rst:36
msgid "Downloads"
msgstr "다운로드"

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_4xx.rst:38
msgid ""
"CI4 is still available as a :doc:`ready-to-run zip or tarball "
"<../installation/installing_manual>`."
msgstr ""
"CI4는 여전히 :doc:`즉시 실행 가능한 zip 또는 tarball <../installation/installing_manual>`\\ 로 "
"제공됩니다."

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_4xx.rst:39
msgid ""
"It can also be installed using :doc:`Composer "
"<../installation/installing_composer>`."
msgstr ""
":doc:`Composer <../installation/installing_composer>`\\ 를 사용하여 설치할 수도 있습니다."

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_4xx.rst:42
msgid "Namespaces"
msgstr "네임스페이스"

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_4xx.rst:44
msgid ""
"CI4 is built for PHP 8.1+, and everything in the framework is namespaced,"
" except for the helper and lang files."
msgstr ""
"CI4는 PHP 8.1 이상을 위해 만들어졌으며, 헬퍼 파일과 lang 파일을 제외한 프레임워크의 모든 것이 네임스페이스를 사용합니다."

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_4xx.rst:48
msgid "Application Structure"
msgstr "애플리케이션 구조"

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_4xx.rst:51
msgid ""
"**index.php** is no longer in the root of the project! It has been moved "
"inside the **public** folder, for better security and separation of "
"components."
msgstr ""
"**index.php**\\ 는 더 이상 프로젝트 루트에 없습니다! 보안 강화와 컴포넌트 분리를 위해 **public** 폴더 안으로 "
"이동되었습니다."

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_4xx.rst:54
msgid ""
"This means that you should configure your web server to \"point\" to your"
" project's **public** folder, and not to the project root."
msgstr ""
"이는 웹 서버가 프로젝트 루트가 아닌 프로젝트의 **public** 폴더를 \"가리키도록\" 설정해야 함을 의미합니다."

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_4xx.rst:57
msgid ""
"If you would use Shared Hosting, see :ref:`deployment-to-shared-hosting-"
"services`."
msgstr ""
"공유 호스팅을 사용하는 경우 :ref:`deployment-to-shared-hosting-services`\\ 를 참조하세요."

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_4xx.rst:59
msgid ""
"The **application** folder is renamed as **app** and the framework still "
"has **system** folders, with the same interpretation as before."
msgstr ""
"**application** 폴더는 **app**\\ 으로 이름이 변경되었으며, 프레임워크에는 이전과 동일한 의미의 **system** "
"폴더가 여전히 존재합니다."

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_4xx.rst:61
msgid ""
"The framework now provides for a **public** folder, intended as the "
"document root for your app."
msgstr "프레임워크는 이제 앱의 문서 루트로 사용되는 **public** 폴더를 제공합니다."

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_4xx.rst:62
msgid ""
"The ``defined('BASEPATH') OR exit('No direct script access allowed');`` "
"line is not necessary because files outside the **public** folder are not"
" accessible in the standard configuration. And CI4 no longer defines the "
"constant ``BASEPATH``, so remove the line in all files."
msgstr ""
"``defined('BASEPATH') OR exit('No direct script access allowed');`` 줄은 "
"표준 설정에서 **public** 폴더 외부의 파일에 접근할 수 없으므로 필요하지 않습니다. 또한 CI4는 더 이상 ``BASEPATH`` "
"상수를 정의하지 않으므로 모든 파일에서 해당 줄을 제거하세요."

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_4xx.rst:65
msgid ""
"There is also a **writable** folder, to hold cache data, logs, and "
"session data."
msgstr "캐시 데이터, 로그, 세션 데이터를 저장하기 위한 **writable** 폴더도 있습니다."

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_4xx.rst:66
msgid ""
"The **app** folder looks very similar to **application** for CI3, with "
"some name changes, and some subfolders moved to the **writable** folder."
msgstr ""
"**app** 폴더는 CI3의 **application** 폴더와 매우 유사하지만, 일부 이름이 변경되고 일부 하위 폴더가 **writable** "
"폴더로 이동되었습니다."

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_4xx.rst:68
msgid ""
"There is no longer a nested **application/core** folder, as we have a "
"different mechanism for extending framework components (see below)."
msgstr ""
"프레임워크 컴포넌트를 확장하는 다른 메커니즘이 있으므로 더 이상 중첩된 **application/core** 폴더가 없습니다(아래 참조)."

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_4xx.rst:72
msgid "Routing"
msgstr "라우팅"

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_4xx.rst:74
msgid ""
"The Auto Routing is disabled by default. You need to :ref:`define all "
"routes <defined-route-routing>` by default."
msgstr ""
"자동 라우팅은 기본적으로 비활성화되어 있습니다. 기본적으로 :ref:`모든 라우트를 정의 <defined-route-routing>`\\ 해야 합니다."

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_4xx.rst:76
msgid ""
"If you want to use the Auto Routing in the same way as CI3, you need to "
"enable :ref:`auto-routing-legacy`."
msgstr ""
"CI3와 동일한 방식으로 자동 라우팅을 사용하려면 :ref:`auto-routing-legacy`\\ 를 활성화해야 합니다."

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_4xx.rst:78
msgid "CI4 also has an optional new more secure :ref:`auto-routing-improved`."
msgstr "CI4에는 선택적으로 사용할 수 있는 더 안전한 새로운 :ref:`auto-routing-improved`\\ 도 있습니다."

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_4xx.rst:81
msgid "Model, View and Controller"
msgstr "모델, 뷰, 컨트롤러"

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_4xx.rst:83
msgid ""
"CodeIgniter is based on the MVC concept. Thus, the changes on the Model, "
"View and Controller are one of the most important things you have to "
"handle."
msgstr ""
"CodeIgniter는 MVC 개념을 기반으로 합니다. 따라서 모델, 뷰, 컨트롤러의 변경 사항은 처리해야 할 가장 중요한 사항 중 "
"하나입니다."

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_4xx.rst:85
msgid ""
"In CodeIgniter 4, models are now located in **app/Models** and you have "
"to add the lines ``namespace App\\Models;`` along with ``use "
"CodeIgniter\\Model;`` right after the opening php tag. The last step is "
"to replace ``extends CI_Model`` with ``extends Model``."
msgstr ""
"CodeIgniter 4에서 모델은 **app/Models**\\ 에 위치하며, PHP 시작 태그 바로 뒤에 ``namespace "
"App\\Models;``\\ 와 ``use CodeIgniter\\Model;`` 줄을 추가해야 합니다. 마지막으로 "
"``extends CI_Model``\\ 을 ``extends Model``\\ 로 교체하세요."

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_4xx.rst:88
msgid ""
"The views of CodeIgniter 4 have been moved to **app/Views**. Furthermore,"
" you have to change the syntax of loading views from "
"``$this->load->view('directory_name/file_name')`` to ``echo "
"view('directory_name/file_name');``."
msgstr ""
"CodeIgniter 4의 뷰는 **app/Views**\\ 로 이동되었습니다. 또한 뷰 로드 문법을 "
"``$this->load->view('directory_name/file_name')``\\ 에서 "
"``echo view('directory_name/file_name');``\\ 로 변경해야 합니다."

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_4xx.rst:91
msgid ""
"Controllers of CodeIgniter 4 have to be moved to **app/Controllers**. "
"After that, add ``namespace App\\Controllers;`` after the opening php "
"tag. Lastly, replace ``extends CI_Controller`` with ``extends "
"BaseController``."
msgstr ""
"CodeIgniter 4의 컨트롤러는 **app/Controllers**\\ 로 이동해야 합니다. 그런 다음 PHP 시작 태그 뒤에 "
"``namespace App\\Controllers;``\\ 를 추가하세요. 마지막으로 ``extends CI_Controller``\\ 를 "
"``extends BaseController``\\ 로 교체하세요."

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_4xx.rst:94
msgid ""
"For more information we recommend you the following upgrade guides, which"
" will give you some step-by-step instructions to convert the MVC classes "
"in CodeIgniter4:"
msgstr ""
"자세한 내용은 CodeIgniter4에서 MVC 클래스를 변환하는 단계별 지침을 제공하는 다음 업그레이드 가이드를 참조하세요:"

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_4xx.rst:105
msgid "Core Class Changes"
msgstr "핵심 클래스 변경 사항"

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_4xx.rst:107
msgid "Input"
msgstr "Input"

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_4xx.rst:108
msgid ""
"CI3's `Input <http://codeigniter.com/userguide3/libraries/input.html>`_ "
"corresponds to CI4's :doc:`IncomingRequest </incoming/incomingrequest>`."
msgstr ""
"CI3의 `Input <http://codeigniter.com/userguide3/libraries/input.html>`_\\ 은 "
"CI4의 :doc:`IncomingRequest </incoming/incomingrequest>`\\ 에 해당합니다."

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_4xx.rst:110
msgid ""
"For historical reasons, CI3 and CI4 used incorrect HTTP method names like"
" \"get\", \"post\". Since v4.5.0, CI4 uses the correct HTTP method names "
"like \"GET\", \"POST\"."
msgstr ""
"역사적인 이유로 CI3와 CI4는 \"get\", \"post\"와 같이 잘못된 HTTP 메서드 이름을 사용했습니다. v4.5.0부터 "
"CI4는 \"GET\", \"POST\"와 같이 올바른 HTTP 메서드 이름을 사용합니다."

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_4xx.rst:113
msgid "Output"
msgstr "Output"

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_4xx.rst:114
msgid ""
"CI3's `Output <http://codeigniter.com/userguide3/libraries/output.html>`_"
" corresponds to CI4's :doc:`Responses </outgoing/response>`."
msgstr ""
"CI3의 `Output <http://codeigniter.com/userguide3/libraries/output.html>`_\\ 은 "
"CI4의 :doc:`Responses </outgoing/response>`\\ 에 해당합니다."

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_4xx.rst:118
msgid "Class Loading"
msgstr "클래스 로딩"

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_4xx.rst:120
msgid ""
"There is no longer a CodeIgniter \"superobject\", with framework "
"component references magically injected as properties of your controller."
msgstr ""
"더 이상 프레임워크 컴포넌트 참조가 컨트롤러의 속성으로 자동 주입되는 CodeIgniter \"슈퍼 오브젝트\"가 없습니다."

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_4xx.rst:122
msgid ""
"Classes are instantiated where needed, and framework components are "
"managed by :doc:`../concepts/services`."
msgstr ""
"클래스는 필요한 곳에서 인스턴스화되며, 프레임워크 컴포넌트는 :doc:`../concepts/services`\\ 에서 관리합니다."

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_4xx.rst:124
msgid ""
"The :doc:`Autoloader <../concepts/autoloader>` automatically handles "
"PSR-4 style class locating, within the ``App`` (**app** folder) and "
"``CodeIgniter`` (i.e., **system** folder) top level namespaces; with "
"Composer autoloading support."
msgstr ""
":doc:`오토로더 <../concepts/autoloader>`\\ 는 Composer 오토로딩 지원과 함께 ``App`` "
"(**app** 폴더) 및 ``CodeIgniter`` (**system** 폴더) 최상위 네임스페이스 내에서 PSR-4 스타일의 클래스 "
"찾기를 자동으로 처리합니다."

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_4xx.rst:127
msgid ""
"You can configure the class loading to support whatever application "
"structure you are most comfortable with, including the \"HMVC\" style."
msgstr ""
"\"HMVC\" 스타일을 포함하여 가장 익숙한 애플리케이션 구조를 지원하도록 클래스 로딩을 설정할 수 있습니다."

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_4xx.rst:129
msgid ""
"CI4 provides :doc:`../concepts/factories` that can load a class and share"
" the instance like ``$this->load`` in CI3."
msgstr ""
"CI4는 CI3의 ``$this->load``\\ 와 같이 클래스를 로드하고 인스턴스를 공유할 수 있는 "
":doc:`../concepts/factories`\\ 를 제공합니다."

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_4xx.rst:133
msgid "Libraries"
msgstr "라이브러리"

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_4xx.rst:135
#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_4xx.rst:227
msgid ""
"Your app classes can still go inside **app/Libraries**, but they don't "
"have to."
msgstr "앱 클래스는 여전히 **app/Libraries** 안에 배치할 수 있지만, 반드시 그럴 필요는 없습니다."

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_4xx.rst:136
#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_4xx.rst:228
msgid ""
"Instead of CI3's ``$this->load->library('x');`` you can now use "
"``$this->x = new \\App\\Libraries\\X();``, following namespaced "
"conventions for your component. Alternatively, you can use "
":doc:`../concepts/factories`: ``$this->x = "
"\\CodeIgniter\\Config\\Factories::libraries('X');``."
msgstr ""
"CI3의 ``$this->load->library('x');`` 대신 네임스페이스 규칙에 따라 "
"``$this->x = new \\App\\Libraries\\X();``\\ 를 사용할 수 있습니다. 또는 "
":doc:`../concepts/factories`\\ 를 사용할 수 있습니다: "
"``$this->x = \\CodeIgniter\\Config\\Factories::libraries('X');``."

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_4xx.rst:142
msgid "Helpers"
msgstr "헬퍼"

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_4xx.rst:144
msgid ""
":doc:`Helpers <../general/helpers>` are pretty much the same as before, "
"though some have been simplified."
msgstr ""
":doc:`헬퍼 <../general/helpers>`\\ 는 이전과 거의 동일하지만 일부가 단순화되었습니다."

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_4xx.rst:145
msgid ""
"Since v4.3.0, you can autoload helpers by **app/Config/Autoload.php** as "
"well as CI3."
msgstr ""
"v4.3.0부터 CI3와 마찬가지로 **app/Config/Autoload.php**\\ 를 통해 헬퍼를 자동 로드할 수 있습니다."

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_4xx.rst:146
msgid ""
"Some helpers from CodeIgniter 3 no longer exists in Version 4. For all "
"these helpers, you have to find a new way to implement your functions. "
"These helpers are `CAPTCHA Helper "
"<https://www.codeigniter.com/userguide3/helpers/captcha_helper.html>`_, "
"`Email Helper "
"<https://www.codeigniter.com/userguide3/helpers/email_helper.html>`_. "
"`Path Helper "
"<https://www.codeigniter.com/userguide3/helpers/path_helper.html>`_. and "
"`Smiley Helper "
"<https://www.codeigniter.com/userguide3/helpers/smiley_helper.html>`_."
msgstr ""
"CodeIgniter 3의 일부 헬퍼는 버전 4에 더 이상 존재하지 않습니다. 해당 헬퍼들에 대해서는 기능을 구현하는 새로운 방법을 "
"찾아야 합니다. 해당 헬퍼들은 `CAPTCHA Helper "
"<https://www.codeigniter.com/userguide3/helpers/captcha_helper.html>`_, "
"`Email Helper "
"<https://www.codeigniter.com/userguide3/helpers/email_helper.html>`_, "
"`Path Helper "
"<https://www.codeigniter.com/userguide3/helpers/path_helper.html>`_, "
"`Smiley Helper "
"<https://www.codeigniter.com/userguide3/helpers/smiley_helper.html>`_\\ 입니다."

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_4xx.rst:152
msgid ""
"`Download Helper "
"<https://www.codeigniter.com/userguide3/helpers/download_helper.html>`_ "
"in CI3 was removed. You need to use Response object where you are using "
"``force_download()``. See :ref:`force-file-download`."
msgstr ""
"CI3의 `Download Helper "
"<https://www.codeigniter.com/userguide3/helpers/download_helper.html>`_\\ 가 "
"제거되었습니다. ``force_download()``\\ 를 사용하는 곳에서 Response 객체를 사용해야 합니다. "
":ref:`force-file-download`\\ 를 참조하세요."

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_4xx.rst:155
msgid ""
"`Language Helper "
"<https://www.codeigniter.com/userguide3/helpers/language_helper.html>`_ "
"in CI3 was removed. But ``lang()`` is always available in CI4. See "
":php:func:`lang()`."
msgstr ""
"CI3의 `Language Helper "
"<https://www.codeigniter.com/userguide3/helpers/language_helper.html>`_\\ 가 "
"제거되었습니다. 하지만 ``lang()``\\ 은 CI4에서 항상 사용 가능합니다. :php:func:`lang()`\\ 을 참조하세요."

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_4xx.rst:157
msgid ""
"`Typography Helper "
"<https://www.codeigniter.com/userguide3/helpers/typography_helper.html>`_"
" in CI3 wll be :doc:`Typography Library <../libraries/typography>` in "
"CI4."
msgstr ""
"CI3의 `Typography Helper "
"<https://www.codeigniter.com/userguide3/helpers/typography_helper.html>`_\\ 는 "
"CI4에서 :doc:`Typography 라이브러리 <../libraries/typography>`\\ 가 됩니다."

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_4xx.rst:159
msgid ""
"`Directory Helper "
"<https://www.codeigniter.com/userguide3/helpers/directory_helper.html>`_ "
"and `File Helper "
"<https://www.codeigniter.com/userguide3/helpers/file_helper.html>`_ in "
"CI3 will be :doc:`../helpers/filesystem_helper` in CI4."
msgstr ""
"CI3의 `Directory Helper "
"<https://www.codeigniter.com/userguide3/helpers/directory_helper.html>`_\\ 와 "
"`File Helper "
"<https://www.codeigniter.com/userguide3/helpers/file_helper.html>`_\\ 는 "
"CI4에서 :doc:`../helpers/filesystem_helper`\\ 가 됩니다."

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_4xx.rst:162
msgid ""
"`String Helper "
"<https://www.codeigniter.com/userguide3/helpers/string_helper.html>`_ "
"functions in CI3 are included in :doc:`../helpers/text_helper` in CI4."
msgstr ""
"CI3의 `String Helper "
"<https://www.codeigniter.com/userguide3/helpers/string_helper.html>`_ 함수들은 "
"CI4의 :doc:`../helpers/text_helper`\\ 에 포함되어 있습니다."

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_4xx.rst:164
msgid "In CI4, ``redirect()`` is completely changed from CI3's."
msgstr "CI4에서 ``redirect()``\\ 는 CI3와 완전히 달라졌습니다."

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_4xx.rst:165
msgid ""
"`redirect() Documentation CodeIgniter 3.x "
"<https://codeigniter.com/userguide3/helpers/url_helper.html#redirect>`_"
msgstr ""
"`redirect() 문서 CodeIgniter 3.x "
"<https://codeigniter.com/userguide3/helpers/url_helper.html#redirect>`_"

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_4xx.rst:166
msgid ""
"`redirect() Documentation CodeIgniter 4.x "
"<../general/common_functions.html#redirect>`_"
msgstr ""
"`redirect() 문서 CodeIgniter 4.x "
"<../general/common_functions.html#redirect>`_"

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_4xx.rst:167
msgid ""
"In CI4, :php:func:`redirect()` returns a ``RedirectResponse`` instance "
"instead of redirecting and terminating script execution. You must return "
"it from Controllers or Controller Filters."
msgstr ""
"CI4에서 :php:func:`redirect()`\\ 는 리다이렉트하고 스크립트 실행을 종료하는 대신 ``RedirectResponse`` "
"인스턴스를 반환합니다. 컨트롤러 또는 컨트롤러 필터에서 이를 반환해야 합니다."

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_4xx.rst:170
msgid ""
"Cookies and Headers you set before calling ``redirect()`` are not "
"automatically carried over to a ``RedirectResponse``. You need to call "
"``withCookies()`` or ``withHeaders()`` manually if you want to send them."
msgstr ""
"``redirect()``\\ 를 호출하기 전에 설정한 쿠키와 헤더는 ``RedirectResponse``\\ 에 자동으로 전달되지 "
"않습니다. 이를 전송하려면 ``withCookies()`` 또는 ``withHeaders()``\\ 를 수동으로 호출해야 합니다."

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_4xx.rst:173
msgid ""
"You need to change CI3's ``redirect('login/form')`` to ``return "
"redirect()->to('login/form')``."
msgstr ""
"CI3의 ``redirect('login/form')``\\ 을 ``return redirect()->to('login/form')``\\ 으로 "
"변경해야 합니다."

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_4xx.rst:176
msgid "Hooks"
msgstr "훅"

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_4xx.rst:178
msgid ""
"`Hooks <https://www.codeigniter.com/userguide3/general/hooks.html>`_ have"
" been replaced by :doc:`../extending/events`."
msgstr ""
"`훅 <https://www.codeigniter.com/userguide3/general/hooks.html>`_\\ 은 "
":doc:`../extending/events`\\ 로 대체되었습니다."

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_4xx.rst:180
msgid ""
"Instead of CI3's ``$hook['post_controller_constructor']`` you now use "
"``Events::on('post_controller_constructor', ['MyClass', "
"'MyFunction']);``, with the namespace ``CodeIgniter\\Events\\Events;``."
msgstr ""
"CI3의 ``$hook['post_controller_constructor']`` 대신 이제 네임스페이스 "
"``CodeIgniter\\Events\\Events;``\\ 와 함께 "
"``Events::on('post_controller_constructor', ['MyClass', 'MyFunction']);``\\ 를 "
"사용합니다."

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_4xx.rst:182
msgid "Events are always enabled, and are available globally."
msgstr "이벤트는 항상 활성화되어 있으며 전역적으로 사용 가능합니다."

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_4xx.rst:183
msgid ""
"The hook point ``pre_controller`` and ``post_controller`` have been "
"removed. Use :doc:`../incoming/filters` instead."
msgstr ""
"훅 포인트 ``pre_controller``\\ 와 ``post_controller``\\ 가 제거되었습니다. 대신 "
":doc:`../incoming/filters`\\ 를 사용하세요."

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_4xx.rst:185
msgid ""
"The hook point ``display_override`` and ``cache_override`` have been "
"removed. Because the base methods have been removed."
msgstr ""
"기본 메서드가 제거되었으므로 훅 포인트 ``display_override``\\ 와 ``cache_override``\\ 가 제거되었습니다."

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_4xx.rst:187
msgid ""
"The hook point ``post_system`` has moved just before sending the final "
"rendered page."
msgstr "훅 포인트 ``post_system``\\ 은 최종 렌더링된 페이지를 전송하기 직전으로 이동되었습니다."

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_4xx.rst:191
msgid "Error Handling"
msgstr "오류 처리"

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_4xx.rst:193
msgid "The behavior in CI4 has been slightly changed."
msgstr "CI4에서 동작 방식이 약간 변경되었습니다."

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_4xx.rst:195
msgid "In CI3 the behavior is set in the **index.php** file:"
msgstr "CI3에서 동작 방식은 **index.php** 파일에서 설정됩니다:"

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_4xx.rst:197
msgid ""
"errors with the error level set by ``error_reporting()`` are logged (but "
"depending on the ``log_threshold`` setting, they may not be written to "
"the log file)."
msgstr ""
"``error_reporting()``\\ 로 설정된 오류 레벨의 오류는 기록됩니다(단, ``log_threshold`` 설정에 따라 "
"로그 파일에 기록되지 않을 수 있습니다)."

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_4xx.rst:200
msgid ""
"errors with an error level of ``E_ERROR | E_PARSE | E_COMPILE_ERROR | "
"E_CORE_ERROR | E_USER_ERROR`` stopped framework processing, regardless of"
" the error level set in ``error_reporting()``."
msgstr ""
"``E_ERROR | E_PARSE | E_COMPILE_ERROR | E_CORE_ERROR | E_USER_ERROR`` 오류 레벨의 "
"오류는 ``error_reporting()``\\ 에 설정된 오류 레벨에 관계없이 프레임워크 처리를 중단시킵니다."

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_4xx.rst:204
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"In CI4, the behavior is set in the **app/Config/Boot/{environment}.php** "
"file:"
msgstr "CI4에서 동작 방식은 **app/Config/Boot/{environment}.php** 파일에서 설정됩니다:"

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_4xx.rst:206
msgid ""
"errors with the error level set by ``error_reporting()`` are logged (but "
"depending on the ``Config\\Logger::$threshold`` setting, they may not be "
"written to the log file)."
msgstr ""
"``error_reporting()``\\ 로 설정된 오류 레벨의 오류는 기록됩니다(단, "
"``Config\\Logger::$threshold`` 설정에 따라 로그 파일에 기록되지 않을 수 있습니다)."

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_4xx.rst:209
msgid ""
"all errors that are not ignored by ``error_reporting()`` will stop the "
"framework processing."
msgstr "``error_reporting()``\\ 에 의해 무시되지 않는 모든 오류는 프레임워크 처리를 중단시킵니다."

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_4xx.rst:213
msgid "Extending the Framework"
msgstr "프레임워크 확장"

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_4xx.rst:215
msgid ""
"You don't need a **core** folder to hold ``MY_...`` framework component "
"extensions or replacements."
msgstr "``MY_...`` 프레임워크 컴포넌트 확장 또는 교체를 위한 **core** 폴더가 필요하지 않습니다."

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_4xx.rst:217
msgid ""
"You don't need ``MY_X`` classes inside your libraries folder to extend or"
" replace CI4 pieces."
msgstr "CI4 컴포넌트를 확장하거나 교체하기 위해 라이브러리 폴더에 ``MY_X`` 클래스가 필요하지 않습니다."

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_4xx.rst:219
msgid ""
"Make any such classes where you like, and add appropriate service methods"
" in **app/Config/Services.php** to load your components instead of the "
"default ones."
msgstr ""
"원하는 위치에 해당 클래스를 만들고, 기본 컴포넌트 대신 직접 만든 컴포넌트를 로드하도록 "
"**app/Config/Services.php**\\ 에 적절한 서비스 메서드를 추가하세요."

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_4xx.rst:222
msgid "See :doc:`../extending/core_classes` for details."
msgstr "자세한 내용은 :doc:`../extending/core_classes`\\ 를 참조하세요."

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_4xx.rst:225
msgid "Upgrading Libraries"
msgstr "라이브러리 업그레이드"

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_4xx.rst:232
msgid ""
"Some libraries from CodeIgniter 3 no longer exists in Version 4. For all "
"these libraries, you have to find a new way to implement your functions. "
"These libraries are `Calendaring "
"<http://codeigniter.com/userguide3/libraries/calendar.html>`_, `FTP "
"<http://codeigniter.com/userguide3/libraries/ftp.html>`_, `Javascript "
"<http://codeigniter.com/userguide3/libraries/javascript.html>`_, "
"`Shopping Cart <http://codeigniter.com/userguide3/libraries/cart.html>`_,"
" `Trackback "
"<http://codeigniter.com/userguide3/libraries/trackback.html>`_, `XML-RPC "
"/-Server <http://codeigniter.com/userguide3/libraries/xmlrpc.html>`_, and"
" `Zip Encoding <http://codeigniter.com/userguide3/libraries/zip.html>`_."
msgstr ""
"CodeIgniter 3의 일부 라이브러리는 버전 4에 더 이상 존재하지 않습니다. 해당 라이브러리들에 대해서는 기능을 구현하는 새로운 "
"방법을 찾아야 합니다. 해당 라이브러리들은 `Calendaring "
"<http://codeigniter.com/userguide3/libraries/calendar.html>`_, `FTP "
"<http://codeigniter.com/userguide3/libraries/ftp.html>`_, `Javascript "
"<http://codeigniter.com/userguide3/libraries/javascript.html>`_, "
"`Shopping Cart <http://codeigniter.com/userguide3/libraries/cart.html>`_, "
"`Trackback "
"<http://codeigniter.com/userguide3/libraries/trackback.html>`_, `XML-RPC "
"/-Server <http://codeigniter.com/userguide3/libraries/xmlrpc.html>`_, "
"`Zip Encoding <http://codeigniter.com/userguide3/libraries/zip.html>`_\\ 입니다."

#: ../../source/installation/upgrade_4xx.rst:241
msgid ""
"All the other libraries, which exist in both CodeIgniter versions, can be"
" upgraded with some adjustments. The most important and mostly used "
"libraries received an Upgrade Guide, which will help you with simple "
"steps and examples to adjust your code."
msgstr ""
"두 CodeIgniter 버전 모두에 존재하는 다른 모든 라이브러리는 일부 조정을 통해 업그레이드할 수 있습니다. 가장 중요하고 많이 "
"사용되는 라이브러리에는 코드를 조정하는 데 도움이 되는 간단한 단계와 예제가 포함된 업그레이드 가이드가 제공됩니다."
